# NEG-10 (AC-8): a classifier that never chooses the backup lane fails a loose control.
rule: keep-backup
mutant: backup lane never chosen (rule 8 decides keep)
note: interim killing test: the spec names every rescue loose control; at f64a075 the only one that runs green is artifact_secret's ctl folder. Add a pair per loose control as each rescue test is enabled.
killing-test: rescue artifact_secret
assertion: /ctl/x.bin is Keep: no rule shows it can be regenerated
